{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NoSlack Pets</strong> is an interactive desktop pet game that helps you stay focused while providing the cutest companion to keep you company during work, study, or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re typing, coding, gaming, or binge-watching shows, your personal pet will quietly accompany you on screen:<br><strong>typing sync, idle treasure chests, headgear customization, cat house decoration, relaxing mini-games, white noise meditation</strong>...<br>Enjoy little moments of comfort through your cat's cute actions and gentle music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf &quot;Your cat is trying its best to be with you, while you try your best at life.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong> \u2728</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Desktop Companion Mode + Free Desktop Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, the cat sits on your desktop with a tiny keyboard, mimicking your keystrokes in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1320 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In free mode, it stretches, dances, jumps on the windowsill, and more\u2014bringing stress relief with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca4 <strong>Idle Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>30 minutes of idle time</strong> grants a treasure chest containing adorable <strong>headgear</strong>.<br>Over <strong>400+ headgear</strong> pieces will be available in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf80 <strong>DIY Cat &amp; Cat House Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>gold coins</strong> by staying idle, completing tasks, or leveling up. Spend them to decorate your cat and its cozy room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Parts Include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat Appearance</strong>: Skin, Headgear, Eyes, Mouth, Keyboard Devices, Cursor Effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Decorations</strong>: Walls, Floors, Windows, Lamps, Ornaments, Wall Decorations, Canopy &amp; more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Headgear Collection &amp; Synthesis System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected headgear is saved in a <strong>collection book</strong>.<br>Compete with friends on the <strong>leaderboard</strong>, and <strong>fuse duplicates</strong> to unlock <strong>rare limited-edition items</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d4f27f8b30d5db8aed0ced288d5770b7.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf45 <strong>Pomodoro Timer System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in <strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> to focus on work or study.<br>Pair it with <strong>white noise</strong> or <strong>light music</strong>, and let your cat remind you when it\u2019s break time.<br>Finish a cycle to earn <strong>coins and EXP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d70cc6a1ff0f85471cb15662ddde8b98.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Music Player &amp; White Noise System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a range of high-quality <strong>lofi music</strong> and relaxing <strong>ambient sounds</strong>:<br>Rainfall, campfire, forest, keyboard typing, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1927bccb5cade0918b7075a5b621cb58.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/95b1bfbf0b79482b9e3b2bd7c593ac38.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Online Study Rooms &amp; Chill Spaces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public or friend rooms, view active users and leaderboards, and build a relaxing \u201cno fish\u201d (no slacking) zone together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcee <strong>Daily Tasks &amp; Letters from Your Cat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete mini goals like \u201copen a treasure chest\u201d or \u201ccomplete a Pomodoro session\u201d to earn rewards.<br>Your cat also sends you <strong>daily letters</strong>\u2014each with a surprise inside!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mini-Game Center</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <strong>3 game tickets</strong> every day to play light, relaxing mini-games.<br>Finish them to earn coins and EXP, and keep collecting fun and rewarding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/8398f6b698ed99475e40eef44d368ba6.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>More Features Coming Soon...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Steam Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collected headgear will be tradable via Steam inventory.<br>\u2705 <strong>Limited-Time Events</strong> \u2013 Seasonal drops, special synth recipes, and leaderboard challenges.<br>\u2705 <strong>More Rich Interactions</strong> \u2013 Your pet will continue to evolve with new behaviors and animations.<br>\u2705 <strong>More Fun Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Casual games to help you relax and stay engaged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone working, studying, or using a computer who wants a productive, cute companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>\u201cLoFi + Cozy + Cats\u201d</strong> aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>customization</strong>, <strong>collection</strong>, and <strong>low-pressure interaction</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking an adorable, interactive desktop presence</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Playtest Now Open!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests drop headgear at the following rates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong>: 90.00%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong>: 9.51%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic</strong>: 0.49%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Free <strong>Epic headgear</strong> available during Playtest\u2014don\u2019t miss out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f <strong>A true \u201ccompanion\u201d on your desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax between tasks with the sound of keys and the soothing presence of your desktop buddy.<br><strong>Let your pet make your day a little lighter and a lot more fun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A Message from the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who has left feedback and supported us!<br>Your input keeps us going through long development nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re constantly refining features with <strong>near-daily updates</strong>, and we post <strong>weekly summaries</strong> to keep you up to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde1 Join our [Discord] to chat, report bugs, or talk cats\u2014we\u2019re listening!<br>\ud83c\udf81 Limited-time headgear drops are ongoing!<br>\ud83d\udce2 Wishlist now and don\u2019t miss the next test or surprise event!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714370?t=1757941125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/2d875a80d99ed88dd909969b52eed335a1f535df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757941125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/138dd7fbfe6a5b287f1aa94cb8a02e8bbf70bd88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757941125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/138dd7fbfe6a5b287f1aa94cb8a02e8bbf70bd88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757941125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3738680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NoSlack Pets</strong> is an interactive desktop pet game that helps you stay focused while providing the cutest companion to keep you company during work, study, or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re typing, coding, gaming, or binge-watching shows, your personal pet will quietly accompany you on screen:<br><strong>typing sync, idle treasure chests, headgear customization, cat house decoration, relaxing mini-games, white noise meditation</strong>...<br>Enjoy little moments of comfort through your cat's cute actions and gentle music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf &quot;Your cat is trying its best to be with you, while you try your best at life.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong> \u2728</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Desktop Companion Mode + Free Desktop Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, the cat sits on your desktop with a tiny keyboard, mimicking your keystrokes in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1320 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/b575a22af58b8f561bed4438a8ffa9ba.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In free mode, it stretches, dances, jumps on the windowsill, and more\u2014bringing stress relief with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/90f905ae4620054762253248ae27dd8e.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca4 <strong>Idle Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>30 minutes of idle time</strong> grants a treasure chest containing adorable <strong>headgear</strong>.<br>Over <strong>400+ headgear</strong> pieces will be available in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/be2549cf37db15dc646281d9fc518892.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf80 <strong>DIY Cat &amp; Cat House Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>gold coins</strong> by staying idle, completing tasks, or leveling up. Spend them to decorate your cat and its cozy room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Parts Include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat Appearance</strong>: Skin, Headgear, Eyes, Mouth, Keyboard Devices, Cursor Effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.poster.avif?t=1757941125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.webm?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d2890affd310d9c10ea65ea895536892.mp4?t=1757941125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room Decorations</strong>: Walls, Floors, Windows, Lamps, Ornaments, Wall Decorations, Canopy &amp; more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Headgear Collection &amp; Synthesis System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected headgear is saved in a <strong>collection book</strong>.<br>Compete with friends on the <strong>leaderboard</strong>, and <strong>fuse duplicates</strong> to unlock <strong>rare limited-edition items</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d4f27f8b30d5db8aed0ced288d5770b7.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf45 <strong>Pomodoro Timer System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in <strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> to focus on work or study.<br>Pair it with <strong>white noise</strong> or <strong>light music</strong>, and let your cat remind you when it\u2019s break time.<br>Finish a cycle to earn <strong>coins and EXP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/d70cc6a1ff0f85471cb15662ddde8b98.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Music Player &amp; White Noise System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a range of high-quality <strong>lofi music</strong> and relaxing <strong>ambient sounds</strong>:<br>Rainfall, campfire, forest, keyboard typing, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1927bccb5cade0918b7075a5b621cb58.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/95b1bfbf0b79482b9e3b2bd7c593ac38.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Online Study Rooms &amp; Chill Spaces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public or friend rooms, view active users and leaderboards, and build a relaxing \u201cno fish\u201d (no slacking) zone together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcee <strong>Daily Tasks &amp; Letters from Your Cat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete mini goals like \u201copen a treasure chest\u201d or \u201ccomplete a Pomodoro session\u201d to earn rewards.<br>Your cat also sends you <strong>daily letters</strong>\u2014each with a surprise inside!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mini-Game Center</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <strong>3 game tickets</strong> every day to play light, relaxing mini-games.<br>Finish them to earn coins and EXP, and keep collecting fun and rewarding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/8398f6b698ed99475e40eef44d368ba6.avif?t=1757941125\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>More Features Coming Soon...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Steam Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collected headgear will be tradable via Steam inventory.<br>\u2705 <strong>Limited-Time Events</strong> \u2013 Seasonal drops, special synth recipes, and leaderboard challenges.<br>\u2705 <strong>More Rich Interactions</strong> \u2013 Your pet will continue to evolve with new behaviors and animations.<br>\u2705 <strong>More Fun Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Casual games to help you relax and stay engaged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone working, studying, or using a computer who wants a productive, cute companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>\u201cLoFi + Cozy + Cats\u201d</strong> aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>customization</strong>, <strong>collection</strong>, and <strong>low-pressure interaction</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking an adorable, interactive desktop presence</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Playtest Now Open!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests drop headgear at the following rates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong>: 90.00%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong>: 9.51%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic</strong>: 0.49%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Free <strong>Epic headgear</strong> available during Playtest\u2014don\u2019t miss out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f <strong>A true \u201ccompanion\u201d on your desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax between tasks with the sound of keys and the soothing presence of your desktop buddy.<br><strong>Let your pet make your day a little lighter and a lot more fun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A Message from the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who has left feedback and supported us!<br>Your input keeps us going through long development nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re constantly refining features with <strong>near-daily updates</strong>, and we post <strong>weekly summaries</strong> to keep you up to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde1 Join our [Discord] to chat, report bugs, or talk cats\u2014we\u2019re listening!<br>\ud83c\udf81 Limited-time headgear drops are ongoing!<br>\ud83d\udce2 Wishlist now and don\u2019t miss the next test or surprise event!</p>","developers":["Lynkpin Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/ba5fbfc2e5354acfb40485c4d1bc16ffce850f25/header.jpg?t=1757941125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196106/movie480.mp4?t=1757585259","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196106/movie_max.mp4?t=1757585259"},"name":"Noslack Pets-Study Room","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196106/1012a994b47b7d948b2c3bd04af3862455f603b0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757585259","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196106/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757585259","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196106/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757585259"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257178314,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178314/movie480.mp4?t=1757296464","max"